OL,3,GNEWSAAbuse charity saved my life, says
OL,4,Asurvivor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has described how her marriage
OL,7,Fturned from a "love story into a
OL,8,Fnightmare" when she moved from Pakistan
OL,9,Fto the UK.
OL,11,FThe woman, who does not want to be
OL,12,Fnamed, said her husband began
OL,13,Fphysically and mentally abusing her
OL,14,Fafter they got married and settled in
OL,15,FGreater Manchester.
OL,17,FShe said her partner did not tell her
OL,18,Fhe had a child, and she realised her
OL,19,F"fairy tale" was "based on lies".
